                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is very good turn-based strategy with a nice music, good animations of medieval warriors etc. What is a little worse - the landscape could be better, mainly a view of hills. Secondly, they are only French scenarios yet. HexWar Games should work a little more in a case of graphic aspects of their games but a progress about animations and visual quality of units is after all visible. The sounds (melee combat, yelling, shooting, bombard mortar) could be louder. A fog, vapor, fume and raised dust would be also great. Good work anyway.",
